				: 'Owner, Developer, Editor, Analyst and Billing.')}</p> <p><a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://appwrite.io/docs/advanced/platform/roles">Learn more</a> about roles.</p></div>`);
		},
		$$slots: { default: true }
	});
}
